            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.15.0

- Redesigned Settings to look and work like the rest of macOS, with a standard sidebar and grouped options.
- Settings now reopens on the page you last used, and the window title shows where you are.
- Setup options, keyboard shortcuts and the welcome guide now live in General.
- The preview shows the widget at its real size.
]]></description>
